### [TC01] Get all available boxes
GET http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes

### [TC02] Get box by exact name (Matcha Lover Box)
GET http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/boxname/Matcha Lover Box

### [TC03] Get all items from all boxes
GET http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/items

### [TC07] Purchase 1 Matcha Lover Box (default)
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box

### [TC08] Purchase 3 Matcha Lover Boxes
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=3

### [TC09] Try to purchase more boxes than items available (quantity=99)
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=99

### [TC10] Purchase a non-existent box
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Nonexistent Box

### [TC11] Purchase a box with invalid quantity (negative number)
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=-5

### [TC12] Purchase multiple box themes (valid names)
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Matcha Lover Box", "quantity": 2 },
  { "boxName": "Chocolate Lover Box", "quantity": 1 }
]

### [TC13] Purchase with one valid and one invalid box name
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Matcha Lover Box", "quantity": 1 },
  { "boxName": "Nonexistent Box", "quantity": 2 }
]

### [TC14] Purchase with all invalid box names
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Fake Box A", "quantity": 1 },
  { "boxName": "Fake Box B", "quantity": 1 }
]